  - name: "Exorcism"
    description: "A rite of 1-6 hours of prayer and meditation, depending on the strength of the possessing force, that drives out any entity or demon from a possessed person, animal, dwelling or area. The holy symbols of the shaman''s religion are needed, and assistants and bodyguards are wise. The exorcised cannot return for at least 6 months and 86% never do. In a graveyard, tomb or similar area it destroys the animated skeletons, corpses and mummies there; ghouls and zombies are banished for 10 months, and greater supernatural beings (lesser devils and demons, vampires, ghosts, wraiths, specters) for six months. Success: 8% per level of experience; may be attempted as many times as the shaman wants."
